The legal texts come from the Governatorato dello Stato della Città del Vaticano:

  Governatorato dello Stato della Città del Vaticano, Legislazione e normativa,
  https://www.vaticanstate.va/it/stato-e-governo/legislazione-e-normativa.html, retrieved 2026-10-28.

The site states: "Copyright © 2026 by Governatorato dello Stato della Città del Vaticano | Tutti i diritti riservati".
The copies used only for checking come from vatican.va and press.vatican.va (© Dicastero per la Comunicazione -
Libreria Editrice Vaticana). No open licence is offered for these texts. This repository is private; whether and
how it may be published is the owner's decision.

Changes made by Lexifina: each law was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line;
spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; title headings were set in sentence case; annexes A to C (drawn
models) were left out; five character errors in the publisher's PDF text layer were corrected (listed in
REPRODUCE.md); and the texts were arranged as git commits credited to the laws that made each change.
The wording of the law was not otherwise changed. The Governatorato does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
